{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51233","headline":"五祖自咏（时复生再来）（此诗爲後人僞托。） · 弘忍","name":"五祖自咏（时复生再来）（此诗爲後人僞托。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂垂白发下青山，七岁归来改旧颜。\n人却少年松却老，是非从此落人间。\n（《弘治黄州府志》五《人物·仙释》、同上七《艺文·黄梅县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"弘忍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}